# Rockstar Games Launcher. Fixes from frankea/Whisky's LauncherPresets.swift and SteamLauncher.swift
# (GPL-3.0-or-later): Social Club draws with Chromium and needs DXVK; Launcher.exe's D3D12 query
# hangs its exit, which leaves the game "running" in Steam, so d3d12 is off for both, with NVIDIA's
# libraries as for Steam's helpers. Rockstar titles bought on Steam start this launcher inside the
# Steam bottle; the app applies these lines there too.
# Launcher.exe itself draws with Direct2D on Direct3D 10.1, which neither DXVK nor D3DMetal takes
# over here and which wine's Vulkan renderer cannot offer on MoltenVK (no geometry shaders): it
# fails to initialize. Wine's OpenGL renderer can, and the launcher then installs Social Club.
name Rockstar Games Launcher
kind launcher
status experimental
symbol r.circle
about Лаунчер Rockstar (GTA, Red Dead). Ставится сам, при первом запуске докачивает Social Club.
about-en Rockstar's launcher (GTA, Red Dead). Installs by itself and fetches Social Club on its first start.
bottle rockstar
installer https://gamedownloads.rockstargames.com/public/installer/Rockstar-Games-Launcher.exe /s /f
exe C:\Program Files\Rockstar Games\Launcher\Launcher.exe
env WINE_LARGE_ADDRESS_AWARE=1
env LC_ALL=en_US.UTF-8
env CEF_DISABLE_SANDBOX=1
d3d Launcher.exe renderer=gl
dxvk SocialClubHelper.exe
dll Launcher.exe d3d12=,nvapi64=,nvapi=,nvngx=
dll SocialClubHelper.exe d3d12=,nvapi64=,nvapi=,nvngx=
